  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is an even positive integer greater than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the condition that the greatest term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math> may have the greatest coefficient also is"
